graph TD
    Start([User Action]) --> VM[ViewModel.send Input]

    VM --> Service[UserService]
    Service --> Validate{Validate Input}

    Validate -->|Invalid| Error1[Return ValidationError]
    Validate -->|Valid| Repo[UserRepository]

    Repo --> Cache{Check Cache}
    Cache -->|Hit| ReturnCache[Return Cached Data]
    Cache -->|Miss| Local{Check Local DB}

    Local -->|Found| ReturnLocal[Return Local Data<br/>+ Background Sync]
    Local -->|Not Found| Remote[Fetch from Remote API]

    Remote --> Network{Network Available?}
    Network -->|Yes| API[API Request]
    Network -->|No| Offline[Return Offline Error]

    API --> Success{Success?}
    Success -->|Yes| SaveLocal[Save to Local DB]
    Success -->|No| Error2[Return API Error]

    SaveLocal --> UpdateCache[Update Cache]
    UpdateCache --> Return[Return Data]

    ReturnCache --> VMUpdate[Update ViewModel State]
    ReturnLocal --> VMUpdate
    Return --> VMUpdate
    Error1 --> VMUpdate
    Error2 --> VMUpdate
    Offline --> Queue[Queue for Sync]
    Queue --> VMUpdate

    VMUpdate --> UI[SwiftUI Re-render]

    style Start fill:#90caf9
    style VM fill:#ce93d8
    style Service fill:#90caf9
    style Repo fill:#81c784
    style API fill:#fff59d
    style UI fill:#e1bee7
    style Error1 fill:#ef5350
    style Error2 fill:#ef5350
    style Offline fill:#ff9800
